    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c1614e09-3cf7-44ec-9b54-34b4958f5426-image3.png\"> <br/>From conservation of linear momentum <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> . . . (i) <br/>For elastic collision: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> . . . (ii) <br/>From equation (i) &amp; (ii), <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>",
